## 7. Dependency Injection Updates

### Controller DI Pattern
```csharp
// Legacy 4.5.1: Services accessed via static/property injection
// .NET 8.0: Constructor injection

public class HomeController : BasePublicController
{
    private readonly IProductService _productService;
    private readonly ICategoryService _categoryService;
    private readonly IPictureService _pictureService;
    private readonly ILogger<HomeController> _logger;

    public HomeController(
        IProductService productService,
        ICategoryService categoryService,
        IPictureService pictureService,
        ILogger<HomeController> logger)
    {
        _productService = productService;
        _categoryService = categoryService;
        _pictureService = pictureService;
        _logger = logger;
    }
}
```

**Common services needed for UI pages:**
- `IProductService` - Product data
- `ICategoryService` - Category data
- `IPictureService` - Image URLs
- `IWorkContext` - Current customer, language
- `IStoreContext` - Current store
- `ILocalizationService` - Translations
- `IPriceFormatter` - Price display
- `ILogger<T>` - Debug logging

